{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a34c5bac9e33b59c","name":"Daggerstar Swoop Racer","source":{"id":"source:reference-a34c5bac9e33b59c","title":"Daggerstar Swoop Racer","revision":19091,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:17:44Z","sha256":"9afb4e95fbad4553dcf59e1216ea73be57331da841fbba4f87bf9ff51469997f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19091","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Daggerstar%20Swoop%20Racer&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a34c5bac9e33b59c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The design that put ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lhosan Industries"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lhosan_Industries","referenceId":"reference:243f88645fb81a36"}," on the map, the Daggerstar Swoop Racer is an unorthodox design that resembles a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Landspeeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Landspeeder"}," more than a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder Bike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder_Bike"},". Although the rider of the Swoop Racer sits in a cockpit similar to that of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Landspeeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Landspeeder"},", the Daggerstar's light construction, single-pilot capacity, and narrow chassis design qualify it as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder Bike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder_Bike"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lhosan Industries"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lhosan_Industries","referenceId":"reference:243f88645fb81a36"}," produces the Swoop Racer in the lower levels of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taris"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taris","referenceId":"reference:6c77edc098cd2a27"},", capitalizing on the cheap labor, and the love of Swoop Racing that the planet offers. The popularity of the Daggerstar Swoop Racer spread like wildfire, and soon racing enthusiasts began purchasing the Swoop Racers in large quantities.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though the Daggerstar Swoop Racer is incredibly fast, it is not nearly as maneuverable as most ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder Bikes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder_Bikes"},", including the ",{"tag":"a","children":["AeroChaser Speeder Bike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/AeroChaser_Speeder_Bike","referenceId":"reference:99a1108b55bc9000"},". In fact, at high speeds the Daggerstar is sluggish if the pilot attempts to make more than a minor course corrections, and the Swoop Racer has a larger turn radius than most repulsorlift ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},". The Swoop Bike's ability to reach blazing speeds makes it a popular racing craft, but the lack of maneuverability limits the Swoop Racer to drag races on a straight track, with few obstacles in the path.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Daggerstar Swoop Racer Statistics (CL 2)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +8; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 13 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 10), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href